      "questionEn": "How do you say that something sounds or seems a certain way?",
      "answerEn": "Use a form of sonar followed directly by a describing word.",
      "noteEn": "Sonar changes to match the thing giving the impression: la idea suena, las ideas suenan. The describing word also changes when needed to match that thing: razonable becomes razonables. Do not add a before a describing word; sonar a is the separate pattern used before a noun or comparison, as in suena a excusa.",
